{"id":9997,"iid":29,"project_id":18199,"title":"[审计｜未评级｜问题1] 累计本金超出单次资产增量上限，可能导致强退失败","description":"来源：[DEX - TSV 合约审计报告](https://okg-block.sg.larksuite.com/docx/NYPSdzQruohPBOx90CUlFrTegbd)\n\n报告审计 Commit：`6402443e9fc372e8aa52c9ba82cd3e84cb846493`；分支：`main`。\n\n原文快照：2026-10-27T09:27:51Z（文档最后修改时间）。以下保留报告原文，截图为原图；仅转换排版，不代表已复核当前代码或确认修复状态。\n\n## 报告原文\n\n### 问题1: 累计本金超出单次资产增量上限，可能导致强退失败\n\n同一仓位可通过多次合法增仓累积本金，而两个强退入口unwindPositionByTsv()和unwindPosition()均一次性移除全部流动性。在极端价格及足够大的原始供应量下，单次移除产生的资产增量可能超过 int128.max，导致交易回滚，阻碍强退及后续摘牌。目前只限制decimals ≤ 18 ，不限制原始供应量，无法排除此情形；需要确认实际准入资产无法满足触发条件。\n\n| 項目方（產研）反饋 |  |\n|---|---|\n| 审计反馈 |  |","state":"opened","created_at":"2026-10-27T09:45:34.090Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:14:55.592Z","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"labels":[],"milestone":null,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":2461,"username":"zewei.lu","public_email":null,"name":"zewei.lu@okg.com","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8f6a06ace9e6e5d42b74fbb4b3309b3ab7c5c4de1ebfd3070324dcef6def5413?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.okg.com/zewei.lu"},"type":"ISSUE","assignee":null,"user_notes_count":1,"merge_requests_count":0,"upvotes":0,"downvotes":0,"start_date":null,"due_date":null,"confidential":false,"discussion_locked":null,"issue_type":"issue","web_url":"https://gitlab.okg.com/web3-dex/tsv/-/work_items/29","time_stats":{"time_estimate":0,"total_time_spent":0,"human_time_estimate":null,"human_total_time_spent":null},"task_completion_status":{"count":0,"completed_count":0},"weight":null,"blocking_issues_count":0,"has_tasks":true,"task_status":"0 of 0 checklist items completed","_links":{"self":"https://gitlab.okg.com/api/v4/projects/18199/issues/29","notes":"https://gitlab.okg.com/api/v4/projects/18199/issues/29/notes","award_emoji":"https://gitlab.okg.com/api/v4/projects/18199/issues/29/award_emoji","project":"https://gitlab.okg.com/api/v4/projects/18199","closed_as_duplicate_of":null},"references":{"short":"#29","relative